{
  "$description": "Tashi design tokens, direction Air (B2: pure Air plus light lines in long lists). Format: W3C Design Tokens Community Group (DTCG). Primitives under 'color', semantic roles per theme under 'theme'. Components must use 'theme' roles, never primitives or raw hex. Regenerate tokens.css with: node scripts/build-css.mjs",
